ferx                            Nonlinear Mixed Effects Modeling with Rust Backend

-- Fitting --
ferx_fit                        Fit an NLME model (FOCE/FOCEI/GN/SAEM/IMP)
ferx_check_init                 Diagnose initial parameter values before a fit
ferx_inits_from_nca             Suggest starting values from NCA pooling
ferx_sir                        Sampling Importance Resampling for parameter uncertainty

-- Simulation and prediction --
ferx_simulate                   Simulate observations from a model (and optional fit)
ferx_predict                    Population/individual predictions on a dataset
ferx_simulate_with_uncertainty  Simulate with parameter uncertainty (cov matrix or SIR)

-- Model editing --
ferx_model                      Construct a ferx_model object from model + data
ferx_model_new                  Create a new model file from a bundled template
ferx_model_show                 Pretty-print a .ferx model file
ferx_model_edit                 Copy a model file for editing
ferx_model_section              Read a section from a .ferx file
ferx_model_set_section          Replace a section in a .ferx file on disk
ferx_get_section                Read a section from a ferx_model object
ferx_set_section                Replace a section in a ferx_model object
ferx_model_validate             Validate a .ferx model file (parser + structural checks)
ferx_model_inspect              Inspect a compiled model (parameters, ETAs, error model)

-- Diagnostics and output --
summary.ferx_fit                Summary of a ferx_fit
ferx_estimates                  Tidy data frame of parameter estimates and uncertainties
ferx_cor_matrix                 Correlation matrix from the fit covariance
ferx_eta_cov                    Test ETAs against covariates
check_diagnostics               Residual / ETA diagnostic checks
ferx_trace                      Iteration-by-iteration optimizer trace
ferx_plot_trace                 Quick base-R plot of the optimizer trace

-- Utilities --
ferx_example                    Paths to bundled example models and data
ferx_save_fit                   Save a ferx_fit to a .fitrx archive
ferx_load_fit                   Load a ferx_fit from a .fitrx archive
